to point to your data.

00:12:07.590 --> 00:12:08.700
And voila, off you go.

00:12:08.700 --> 00:12:10.450
It can't really get
any simpler than that.

00:12:14.370 --> 00:12:16.920
The next question that comes
up is, what about performance?

00:12:16.920 --> 00:12:19.290
How well do these actually work?

00:12:19.290 --> 00:12:22.200
They work really great
for common use cases.

00:12:22.200 --> 00:12:25.230
For some cases, you
might have a problem

