Well, what we have
enabled is Cloud AutoML

00:12:48.240 --> 00:12:52.370
so that you can provide images
of all of your parts labeled.

00:12:52.370 --> 00:12:54.120
And we may not be able
to distinguish them

00:12:54.120 --> 00:12:55.470
