00:12:55.470 --> 00:12:58.230
We then train a model for you.

00:12:58.230 --> 00:13:00.480
Then you get REST API
endpoint that you can then

00:13:00.480 --> 00:13:02.677
use in your application.

00:13:02.677 --> 00:13:05.010
So the nice thing about that
is it's really easy to use.

00:13:05.010 --> 00:13:06.460
And you don't have to
know machine learning,

00:13:06.460 --> 00:13:07.540
