00:13:16.780 --> 00:13:19.070
And so you get a great
performing model.

00:13:19.070 --> 00:13:20.480
And it's really easy to use.

00:13:20.480 --> 00:13:21.700
So it's been really helpful.

00:13:25.400 --> 00:13:28.610
So that's actually one
