00:27:19.750 --> 00:27:25.190
There's over 14,000 customers
doing ML on GCP today.

00:27:25.190 --> 00:27:27.820
So with our focus
on open, and hybrid,

00:27:27.820 --> 00:27:31.910
and multi-cloud workloads,
our focus on hardware,

00:27:31.910 --> 00:27:33.720
our new services that
