mentioned, new AutoML services,

00:27:37.710 --> 00:27:39.856
high quality APIs--

00:27:39.856 --> 00:27:42.025
it doesn't matter how
you want to do it,

00:27:42.025 --> 00:27:43.870
you should feel excited
that you can do it.

00:27:43.870 --> 00:27:46.794
You should feel confident that
you can successfully do it.

00:27:46.794 --> 00:27:48.460
And Google is the
right partner for you.

